          "worked": "$$\\text{Sector angle}=\\frac{\\text{number of songs}}{\\text{total songs}}\\times360^\\circ$$\nCountry has $100$ songs, pop has $150$ and classical has $50$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Country angle}&=\\frac{100}{600}\\times360^\\circ\\\\&=60^\\circ\\\\\\text{Pop angle}&=\\frac{150}{600}\\times360^\\circ\\\\&=90^\\circ\\\\\\text{Classical angle}&=\\frac{50}{600}\\times360^\\circ\\\\&=30^\\circ\\end{align*}$$",
